  "body": "Our Vendors are serious about selling and have given us firm instructions to present all genuine offers. All buyers in the $5,500,000 plus range are strongly encouraged to inspect and put their best offer forward on or before the Deadline Date. \r\nPositioned just one property back from the golden sands of Milford Beach at the tightly held northern end, this exceptional architectural residence combines location, quality and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nDesigned by Gerrad Hall Architects and completed in 2019 by builders Page and Daley, this “Gold” award-winning home presents virtually as new and remains protected by its Master Build Guarantee. With the beach virtually at your doorstep, Milford Village an easy walk away and the reserve alongside, the location is incredibly hard to beat.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n•\tInsulated block and vertical cedar construction\r\n•\tHeated natural stone flooring\r\n•\tDesigner kitchen with Miele and Liebherr appliances\r\n•\tExpansive open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n•\t9-metre heated saltwater swimming pool\r\n•\tFour double bedrooms and three bathrooms\r\n•\tTwo substantial living areas\r\n•\tUpstairs lounge with bar, gas fire and study area\r\n•\tSuperb master suite with beach and reserve views, large walk-in wardrobe and luxurious ensuite\r\n•\tLarge upper deck capturing views and all-day sun\r\n•\tDouble internal-access garage plus secure gated parking for a Sealegs, motorhome or additional vehicles\r\n•\tSolar panels and battery storage\r\n\r\nGround-floor living flows seamlessly to outdoor entertaining and the heated pool. Upstairs, the master suite enjoys superb beach and reserve views, with a further bedroom, bathroom and substantial second lounge providing excellent separation.\r\n\r\nProperties of this calibre, this close to the sand and with views are incredibly difficult to replace. Importantly, at the indicated range, it sits well below what it would likely cost to acquire comparable land and build a new home of this scale, specification and quality in a similar location today.",
